    "body": "This is linking to the *directionality* and not the *auto directionality*.  So the [directionality](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#the-directionality) of a `slot` element without a `dir` attribute in a shadow root is its [parent directionality](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#parent-directionality), which is defined specially for that case to be the directionality of the host.",
    "created_at": "2023-10-20T03:49:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-20T03:50:46Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9868#discussion_r1366423013",
